# next turn." Turn 1: Bruse enters and exiles a Forest, making a 2/2 white Ox. Turn 3: Bot1's Bovine Intervention gives Bot2
# an Ox of its own, which does not get double strike (not Bot1's); Bruse (no double strike, not an Ox) and Bot1's Ox attack,
